{"synopsis":"Sebuah adaptasi Manga dari Light Novel “The Irregular of the Royal Academy of Magic”, berseri di Weekly Young Jump.\n\n“Sihir.” Sebuah misteri suci yang hanya dapat digunakan oleh mereka yang terpilih. Suatu hari, seorang anak dari daerah kumuh bernama Ars menemukan bahwa dia memiliki kekuatan untuk menggunakan sihir. Seorang penyihir bernama Genos Wilzard belajar dari bakatnya dan membesarkannya, mengubahnya menjadi pembunuh terbesar. Suatu hari, Genos memberinya perintah: Untuk mendaftar di Akademi Sihir …!?\nTw","alternative_title":"로얄아카데미의 불규칙마법~빈민가 출신 최강의 마법사가 로열스 학원에서 타의 추종을 불허합니다~","author":"Kankitsu Yusura","artist":"Nagatsuki Fumi","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"baaeb823-8173-4078-ac1f-0276a344b49f","number":"148","chapter":"148","title":"Chapter 148","date":"2025-11-02","released":"2025-11-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"cf5d09d4-4137-42fc-94fe-1c30cedde754","number":"147","chapter":"147","title":"Chapter 147","date":"2025-10-31","released":"2025-10-31","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"0e198c05-1a89-4635-aebc-aaa16738805d","number":"146","chapter":"146","title":"Chapter 146","date":"2025-10-20","released":"2025-10-20","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"506dffcd-a4b6-44f2-9c7c-1f9ac777a8bb","number":"145","chapter":"145","title":"Chapter 145","date":"2025-10-19","released":"2025-10-19","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"82c1b3b0-265b-48af-b24d-258b694916e4","number":"144","chapter":"144","title":"Chapter 144","date":"2025-10-18","released":"2025-10-18","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"73cfbb06-c6d9-4676-8bd4-4132ceb949e5","number":"143","chapter":"143","title":"Chapter 143","date":"2025-10-05","released":"2025-10-05","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"90a3e07b-e2ae-44cb-bafc-a7c8f89472e9","number":"142","chapter":"142","title":"Chapter 142","date":"2025-10-04","released":"2025-10-04","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"90ca2ea1-df71-472d-b1ac-23179b6b4ac2","number":"141","chapter":"141","title":"Chapter 141","date":"2025-10-03","released":"2025-10-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"a73e587